(A Muslim young man contacted me a while ago\054 weeping\056\056 At the start of his words I) Tj
T*
0 Tw
(thought he was ill\054 or had lost money\054 or missed a chance to emigrate\054 or a girl he) Tj
T*
(loved had rejected him\056 But on listening to the end\054 his weeping was for none of) Tj
T*
(this\056 He was weeping because he had tasted the sweetness of the night prayer\054) Tj
T*
(then was no longer able to pray at night\056) Tj
T*
