11.36 TL
(The second matter\072 Beware of despair\056 I wept this weeping for 5 years and did not) Tj
T*
-0.082123 Tw
(despair for a single day\054 and I knew\054 trusting in Allah\054 that I would return to this great) Tj
T*
0 Tw
-0.009245 Tw
(obedience\056 So beware of weeping the weeping of the despairing\073 weep the weeping) Tj
T*
0 Tw
(of the longing\054 for it is the best weeping you can weep\056 The world took me\054 turning) Tj
T*
-0.080974 Tw
(me over and scattering me\054 from 2016 to 2022\054 from its far east to its middle\054 then to) Tj
T*
0 Tw
(its western borders\054 like the shaking of water in a waterskin\056 Then in a dream in late) Tj
T*
(2016\054 two noble angels on my right and left who prayed the night with me each) Tj
T*
(folded his prayer mat\054 and my prayer mat was folded\073 I knew it was the last night\056) Tj
T*
(And indeed after that I was driven out of my home\054 humiliated and expelled\054 and I) Tj
T*
(roamed the earth to its far east\054 then its middle\054 then its western borders\054 and the) Tj
T*
(world kept chasing me with its exhausting problems until early 2022\056 So did I think I) Tj
T*
(had been cast away\054 and weep the weeping of the despairing\077\041) Tj
T*
